## ⚠️ Anti-Patrones (PROHIBIDO)

### ❌ NO hacer:

1. **Lógica de negocio en componentes** → Usar services
2. **Subscriptions sin unsubscribe** → Usar `takeUntilDestroyed()`
3. **Mutación directa de arrays/objetos** → Inmutabilidad
4. **`any` type** → Tipar correctamente
5. **Estilos inline en templates** → Usar clases CSS
6. **`setTimeout` sin cleanup** → Usar RxJS `timer()`
7. **Fetch API directa** → Usar Supabase client
8. **Hardcodear URLs** → Usar environment variables

```typescript
// ❌ MAL
export class BadComponent {
  users: any; // NO
  
  ngOnInit() {
    this.http.get('https://api.com/users').subscribe(data => {
      this.users = data; // Memory leak
    });
  }
}

// ✅ BIEN
export class GoodComponent {
  private http = inject(HttpClient);
  private destroyRef = inject(DestroyRef);
  
  users = signal<User[]>([]);
  
  ngOnInit() {
    this.http.get<User[]>(environment.apiUrl + '/users')
      .pipe(takeUntilDestroyed(this.destroyRef))
      .subscribe(data => this.users.set(data));
  }
}
```

